  m_Text: 'This sample shows how camera stacking can be used to extend the game world.
    An overlay camera renders a miniature version of the world in pixels that havent
    been drawn to by the base camera. With some scripted translation of the overlay
    camera, we make the miniature backdrop seem full size. '
